@startuml
title FT-013-02 — Conversion job states

[*] --> QUEUED
QUEUED --> RUNNING : worker claims lease
RUNNING --> AWAITING_TRACK_SELECTION : multiple guitar tracks
AWAITING_TRACK_SELECTION --> QUEUED : valid trackIndex selected
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : both PDF and WAV verified + committed
RUNNING --> UNSUPPORTED : format/score outside subset
RUNNING --> FAILED : non-retryable error
RUNNING --> TIMED_OUT : 60s watchdog
RUNNING --> CANCEL_REQUESTED : user cancel
CANCEL_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED : process stopped + scratch removed
QUEUED --> CANCELLED : user cancel
AWAITING_TRACK_SELECTION --> CANCELLED : user cancel
FAILED --> QUEUED : explicit retry when retryable
TIMED_OUT --> QUEUED : explicit retry when retryable
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
UNSUPPORTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
@enduml
